            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>&quot;Stylalgia&quot; or &quot;Eagle's syndrome&quot; is a cervico-facial pain caused by mineralization of stylohioid complex. Anatomical, embryological, clinical and therapeutical features of the syndrome are discussed and a case report is presented.</AbstractText>
